<title>UK: American Express prices $500 mln 7-yr bond, +39 bp.</title>
<headline>American Express prices $500 mln 7-yr bond, +39 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>priced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AMERICAN EXPRESS CO</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    23.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.824    PAY DATE    23.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    99.824    SPREAD	+39 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
